msgctxt "340"
msgid "Huh? Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr "Eh? Signor Kiryu?"

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting."
msgstr "Scusa se ti ho fatto aspettare."

msgctxt "364"
msgid "That's fine, but... I thought it was just gonna be us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "This isn't date-like at all..."
msgstr "Non sembra per niente un appuntamento..."

msgctxt "388"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "I'll wait here, so please come back by yourself, okay...?"
msgstr "Ti aspetto qui, quindi per favore torna quando sarai da solo..."

msgctxt "412"
msgid "*sigh* You're late... What were you even doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Sorry... Just had some business to take care of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Well... okay. I forgive you. But I expect you to make it up to me! I expect "
"a flawless date."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Sure. I'll make it happen... somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Kiryu-san, can I tell you something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Some of the people who request me are actually fans of my mother. She "
"designs bingata, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Wow, she's that well-known?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Yeah... But the thing is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "I've actually been avoiding my mother. For quite some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"It doesn't help that some of her fans who visit me are always bringing her "
"up. It puts me in a real awkward spot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Maybe that's your opportunity to reconnect with her... Telling her about the"
" club and your customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "I don't think I can do that... Now's just not the right time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Why not tell her she has fans, at least? I'm sure it'd make her happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"...Maybe it would.  But I'm sorry. I shouldn't be burdening you with my "
"problems..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "So... Where are we off to today?"
msgstr ""

